<title>UK: EIB sets A$100 million Eurobond due 2002.</title>
<headline>EIB sets A$100 million Eurobond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    26.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
